.nh
.TH "PB-RECORDINGS-KEY-STATUS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recordings-key-status - Show the team's recording key generation, whether you hold a copy and who is waiting for one


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recordings key status [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the state of the team's recording key without changing it: the current generation (0 when the team has none yet; it is created when the first recording starts in the console), whether you hold a copy of it, and which viewers with an ENV vault still wait for a copy. No key material is printed.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--team\fP=""
	team to show; defaults to the active workspace


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-recordings-key(1)\fP
